        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-09-07T14:01:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I sometimes pop in for a look during the afternoon if I'm not otherwise busy. There very rarely appears to be anyone on, though :(. It'd be handy if there was a list in the \"lobby\" showing who's on, plus some means to chat or otherwise engage in communication with those people outside of entering the game creation screen and sitting around hoping that someone will join ;). I'm normally busy in the evenings with Minecraft and stuff, but otherwise I don't mind people adding me to their friends list and asking me if I fancy a game - the worst you'll get is that I say \"no, sorry, I'm busy right now\" ;).</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:25:14.814Z",
